{"id": "robotshop-catalogue-product-route", "repo": "robotshop", "shape": "route", "scope": "cross-service", "query": "where does GET /product/<sku> get handled", "expect_file": "catalogue/server.js", "expect_symbol": "product", "expect_line": 82, "anchor": "app.get('/product/:sku', (req, res) => {", "alt_files": [], "expect_related": ["cart/server.js", "ratings/html/src/Service/CatalogueService.php", "web/static/js/controller.js"], "why": "catalogue/server.js:82 is the only handler for that path. Three callers in three languages reach it: cart/server.js:362 (Node), ratings/html/src/Service/CatalogueService.php:27 (PHP) and web/static/js/controller.js:244 through the nginx proxy at web/default.conf.template:61. It is the serving side of robotshop-ratings-catalogue-call."}

